{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap into <i>SAGE</i>, a co-op adventure game about frog wizards. Play solo or join up to 12 other fledgling mages on a journey to become a SAGE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/1379a4cdb23fceb9006532ce38e08f4d.avif?t=1762427208\" width=598 height=345 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate with magic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the newest recruit in the village, learn to navigate the biomes of the world, explore the dungeon depths, and protect the creatures of the forest from a growing darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/7ba72bd2beffa3d9d055c3e4c95a2d01.avif?t=1762427208\" width=598 height=345 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow the path to enlightenment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your journey, you will collect unique resources, master spells, level up gear, and sip fragrant teas with fellow adventurers. A cast of villagers and merchant will seek your help and guide you along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/f4f59353947775bc22f6c08e48ab48b6.avif?t=1762427208\" width=598 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy hangout spots everywhere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find loot and hard to catch creatures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 